          <td>Ensures products are correctly filtered and adhere to local advertising laws.</td>
          <td>Food, Beverages & Tobacco > Beverages > Alcoholic Beverages (ID: 499676)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Targeting/Bidding Structure</td>
